                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">全体师生</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">：</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">　　秋季开学在即，为了营造安全和谐稳定的校园环境，全力维护教育系统安全稳定，为迎接党的二十大创造安定和谐氛围。决定组织开展以</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“共建平安校园·健康快乐成长”为主题的2022年中小学生（幼儿）“秋季开学安全第一课”专题教育活动。现就有关事项通知如下：</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px">　　<span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">一、活动主题</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px">　　<span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">共建平安校园</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">·健康快乐成长</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px">　　<span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">二、活动时间</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px">　　<span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">2022年9月1日—9月30日</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px">　　<span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">三、活动对象</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px">　　<span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">全市中小学生及幼儿</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px">　　<span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">四、活动形式、内容及参与办法</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px">　　<span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">1.班主任（教师）通过平台提供的“秋季开学安全第一课”视频资源，开展线上教学，对本班学生进行校园安全、心理健康、消防安全、防欺凌、实验室安全等安全知识普及，进一步提升学生安全素养，严防各类安全事故发生，确保“平安开学、开学平安”。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">　　<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">2.学生登录绍兴市学校安全教育平台，点击“秋季开学安全第一课”专题宣传图片或到“我的学习”中参与相关知识学习，确保以积极阳光的心态迎接新学期。同时，参与相关问卷调查，以便了解“双减”政策实施的效果。</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px">　　<span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">五、组织要求</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px">　　<span style="font-family:仿宋">1.精心组织：</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px">学校</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">要高度重视，强化秋季开学安全教育的必要性和重要性，抓住时机，对</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">2022年中小学生（幼儿）“秋季安全开学第一课”专题教育活动的开展时间、内容、形式、组织管理等做出周密安排，制定出具体可行的活动方案，确保“秋季开学安全第一课”专题教育活动覆盖到每一个班级、每一名学生。</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px">　　<span style="font-family:仿宋">2.加强督查：</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">绍兴市教育局</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">要对各学校的开展情况进行督查，联合新闻媒体对开展情况进行宣传报道。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px">　　<span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">六、数据反馈</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px">　　<span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">学校</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">安全处监督并及时统计</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">班级、学生的详细完成情况。</span></p><p style="margin-left:43px;text-indent:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px"><span style="font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">七、</span><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">联系方式</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">学校</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">安全处</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">沈祥土老师</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">，联系电话：</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">85338037.</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"> </span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px"><strong>　　</strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">附件：</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">1.教师授课流程</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">　　　　　<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">2.学生学习流程</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"> </span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">                                                        <span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">绍兴一中安全处</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">                                                            <span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">2022年8月30日</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px"> </span></strong></p><p style="line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px"> </span></strong></p><p style="line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:黑体">附件</span><span style="font-family:黑体">1：</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">教师授课流程</span></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正小标宋简体;font-size:29px">2022年中小学生（幼儿）“秋季开学安全第一课”专题教育活动</span></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">（活动时间：</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">2022年9月1日—9月30日）</span></span></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px">　　第一步：</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">班主任（教师）</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">用自己的帐号登录学校安全教育平台。</span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px">　　第二步：</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">点击</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">“秋季开学安全第一课”专题宣传图片，进入专题页面。</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px">　　第三步：</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">点击</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">“学校版”，选择相应年级的“秋季开学安全第一课”教育视频资源，对本班学生开展校园安全、心理健康、消防安全、防欺凌、实验室安全等安全教育。</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px">　　第四步：</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">通知学生用帐号登录学校安全教育平台，点击</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">“秋季开学安全第一课”宣传图片或从“我的学习”中进入专题页面，参与相关知识学习，并完成问卷调查。</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px"> </span></strong></p><p style="line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:黑体">附件</span><span style="font-family:黑体">2：</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">学生学习流程</span></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正小标宋简体;font-size:29px">2022年中小学生（幼儿）“秋季开学安全第一课”专题教育活动</span></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">（活动时间：</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">2022年9月1日—9月30日）</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:120%"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">尊敬的家长朋友：</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:120%"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">您好！秋季开学期间，各类学生安全事故易发、多发。为进一步增强广大学生的安全防范意识和应急避险能力，为学生普及校园安全、反恐防暴、心理健康、消防安全、防欺凌等常见安全事项的相关知识和防范技能，避免各类安全事故对学生造成的伤害，让每一位学生都能够平安、快乐、健康成长。根据教育部门的要求，在学校安全教育平台开展</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">2022年</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">中小学生（幼儿）</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">“秋季开学安全第一课”专题教育</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">活动，具体参与方式如下：</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;page-break-after:avoid;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:120%"><strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">方式一：电脑参加</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:120%"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">第一步：用学生的帐号登录学校安全教育平台，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">点击</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">“</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">秋季开学安全第一课</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">”</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">宣传</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">图片或</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">从</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">“我的学习”</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">中</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">进入专题页面。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:120%"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">第二步：点击</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">“家庭版”，</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">参与相关知识学习</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">，并完成问卷调查，完成后点击提交即可。</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;page-break-after:avoid;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:120%"><strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:16px">方式二：手机参加</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;page-break-after:avoid;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:120%">
</p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;page-break-after:avoid;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:120%"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2022/8/202208310908358292.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202208310908358292.png" /></p><p><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">活动咨询电话：</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">400</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 19px">-</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 19px">605</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 19px">-</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 19px">6508（工作日 上午9:00—下午5:00）</span></strong></p><p>
</p>
    
